      "content": "thanks for the validation. i knew i wasn't just imaging it. its not just \"mood\" though, it feels like it's meant to make us more compliant, like we're too stressed to question anything. i've been trying to record the audio when the lights dim but my phone mic isn't picking up the sub-audibles. do you know what kind of frequency ranges or wave patterns might be used for this kind of psychological influence? i want to see if i can find a way to detect it more accurately.",
